 "notes": [
  "Qty 59 as published: the 'Weapons (3)' header lists only Mara Jade's Lightsaber and Vader's Lightsaber; the other headers (1/10/18/9/13/6) match their lists.",
  "The strategy's starting Effect varies by matchup (Security Precautions vs Hidden Base; IAO or Bad Feeling Have I vs MWYHL; IAO, Secret Plans or CHYBC vs Profit; Crush vs Revo; IAO or Battle Order vs Ops), so no single starting Effect is set.",
  "Byline 'Butt \"ltkettch\" Munch' is a joke name; credited by the DeckTech handle ltkettch (existing page, as for post 13565).",
  "Come Here You Big Coward and Secret Plans are the Special Edition Effects (April 2000; Defensive Shields came later). The strategy's note that Limited Resources, It's Worse and Point Man are cycled for Torture, Circle or Sniper, and Bossk With Mortar Gun for Bossk In Hound's Tooth, is not applied."
